---
import { CircleCheckIcon, ShieldCheckIcon } from '@lucide/vue'
import { SAFETY_BOUNDARIES, SITE, TRUST_STATS } from '@/lib/site'
---

<section id="trust" class="section" aria-labelledby="trust-title">
  <div class="container-page">
    <div class="reveal max-w-2xl">
      <p class="eyebrow">安全边界</p>
      <h2 id="trust-title" class="section-title">为什么可以放心装进 Mac</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">
        这个工具要读写 SMC、拦系统事件，还要删文件。权限给出去之前，先看它拿这些权限做什么、做到哪一步。
      </p>
    </div>

    <ul class="reveal mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {
        TRUST_STATS.map((stat) => (
          <li class="card-surface px-4 py-3">
            <p class="text-primary text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight">{stat.value}</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium">{stat.label}</p>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground mt-0.5 text-xs leading-5">{stat.hint}</p>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ul>

    <div class="reveal card-surface mt-4 p-5 sm:p-6">
      <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-base font-semibold">
        <ShieldCheckIcon class="text-primary size-4" />
        写在代码里的硬约束
      </h3>
      <ul class="mt-4 grid gap-x-6 gap-y-2.5 sm:grid-cols-2">
        {
          SAFETY_BOUNDARIES.map((item) => (
            <li class="text-muted-foreground flex gap-2.5 text-sm leading-6">
              <CircleCheckIcon class="text-primary mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0" />
              <span>{item}</span>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground border-border mt-4 border-t pt-4 text-xs leading-6">
        基于 {SITE.license} 开源，全部源码公开可审计；当前版本 {SITE.version}，要求 {SITE.osRequirement}。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
